# {{lb|mul|cards}} Symbol on [[playing cards]] for [[hearts]]
# Stylistic substitution for the word ''love'' (or for its equivalent in another language).
#: I♡NY - "I '''love''' New York"

====Usage notes====
Unicode defines U+2661 codepoint as the ''white heart suit''. But [[:w:Tahoma (typeface)|Tahoma]] which is a default font displays it as [[≡]].

